            "review_text": "Deckard22\nBradford, United Kingdom25 contributions\n2\nMost disgusting food in vietnam\nMar 2019 • Friends\nVietnamese friends took us here because the pork dishes are meant to be fantastic.\n\nWe ordered a quarter of a pig. \nWhen it arrived I put the first piece in my mouth thinking it was a trotted. It wasn't.\n\nIt was a pig jaw, full of teeth.\n\nDisgusting.\n\nIt made me feel sick and none of us could finish our meal. \nOthers had beef, which was like rubber and the fries were cold and horrible.\n\nWhen we called the manager over to complain he told us it was Vietnamese tradition to eat the jaw.\n\nNo it is not. \n\nI took a picture, not a very good one, to share with the world what we were served.\n\nI am worried that I may be I'll to night with food poisoning.\nRead more\nWritten March 9, 2019",
